WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Grandpa, I’m Mr. Xiaoyun on weekends.

2
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:09,130
Mr. Yun, in the future your granddaughter will definitely be inferior to Lao Fengsheng.

3
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:11,130
Please give me your blessings

4
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:13,130
thank me a lot

5
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:15,130
Does the little guy understand?

6
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,130
Have a meal

7
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:22,780
No, no, Mr. Yun, we still have things to do, so I’ll take my leave now, Dad.

8
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:25,780
Open your mouth and shut up, it's your father, shame on you

9
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:28,780
Two freeloaders, even the children can't stand it

10
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,780
Grandpa is Yundong

11
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:35,000
Baby, Mr. Xiaoyun

12
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Yes, come on, baby

13
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
From now on, all grandpa’s shares belong to the baby.

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Mr. Yun, you are still wrong.

15
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Baby wants you to be wrong

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
It's a big gift

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,130
Brother, I've thought about it

18
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:52,130
I work well in the company, and I won't be promoted to the top.

19
00:00:52,130 --> 00:00:55,130
When Rainbow Dash grows up, tell him to support me in his old age.

20
00:00:55,130 --> 00:00:57,130
Brother, brother, why don’t you say anything and get out
